Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.94,0:00:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a Poisoner, Dio Brando.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have all the proof I\Nrequire, and then some!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's found his proof, so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This moment's been a\Nlong time coming, JoJo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I finish what I started!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
