Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.93,0:02:01.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(850,0)\pos(1245,822)\bord3.5\blur2}Episode 3: "Youth With Dio"
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.93,0:02:01.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(850,0)\pos(1245,822)}Episode 3: "My Youth With Dio"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:02:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tracked down the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father took it moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.84,0:02:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, this pains me greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For years, you were my brother, and now\NI have no recourse but to turn you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, I'm sure you don't believe a word\Nof it, but I'm telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even now you show compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, I've been a devil,\Nbut grant me this one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.66,0:02:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,allow me to do the right\Nthing for once in my life And
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,turn myself in what's this\NI thought once I confronted
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him he'd fight me tooth and\Nnail like a cornered beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should be dead in a gutter right? now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must distract him long enough\Nwith a knife and mask to find
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.82,0:02:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wicked deeds gnaw at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poverty I Knew as a child ate away at\Nmy moral compass until greed was all that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remained.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.73,0:03:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the lowest of the low.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father took me in off the street\Nand I repaid his kindness with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.36,0:03:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason I came back\Nwas to surrender myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'd wanted to flee, You never\Nwould have laid eyes on me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.52,0:03:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to make amends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.31,0:03:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look alive, Master Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.98,0:03:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to lure you in like he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right about now, you're\Nprobably wondering who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to elucidate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.26,0:03:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name is Robert E .O. Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a hunch Jonathan's run\Nof trouble might not be done,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I followed him back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like you, Jonathan, so I'm going to\Noffer up this little tidbit pro bono.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Living in the gutter,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you learn to spot lowlights pretty\Nquick if you want to see tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.80,0:03:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've trained my nose to sort out the bad\Nones from the good just from a sniff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.30,0:03:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Fool reeks of brimstone and blood\Nworse than anyone I've ever laid eyes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.56,0:04:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is pure evil, right\Ndown to his very bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.50,0:04:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he a victim of\Ncircumstance, you're wondering?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not on your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been evil since he\Ndrew his first breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't you fret, because I\Nbrought you a friend. Remember him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man confessed to selling you\Nthe poison you used on Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.40,0:04:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You break my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.36,0:04:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, dear, from the day you arrived, I have\Nloved you as though you were my own son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, you're too weak to be down here.\NYou're right. I'll return to my chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.40,0:04:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see my\Nboy in chains do what
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must Jojo i will is\Nthis how it all ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't see the inside\Nof a cell this night i
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,read his face and the\Ntrio of moors on his ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The devil smiles on him\Nand grants him luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, I want you to be the\None to put the cuffs on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, he's a crafty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, it was hubris that led\Nme to this ignominious end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fall from grace has taught me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.24,0:05:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However one may scheme and dissemble,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my downfall this night is\Npart of the human condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A condition I now forsake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, forsake? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I am about to\Nbecome so much more!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me shed this mortal skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.84,0:05:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother's mask? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire at will, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, your blood is the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:05:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fulver!
