Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have blocked his knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I saw it, I froze up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you paid the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was your mother's, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.20,0:06:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't a doctor on Earth who can fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd that devil get the drop on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.26,0:06:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I hadn't listened\Nto you, Sir Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had run his father out of town\Nyears ago like I'd have mind to,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,none of this would have taken\Nplace! Hold on. Whose father?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.94,0:07:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when I first joined the Force,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there was a ne 'er-do-well\Nwho tried to pawn
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that very ring you now\Nsee on Joestar's finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The suspect was Dio's\Nbirth father, Dario Brando.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.70,0:07:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's mine, of that there's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.24,0:07:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My late wife and I had them\Nmade to celebrate our betrothal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.34,0:07:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A local cut purse by the name of\NDario Brando was trying to sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Joestar thought he owed his life\Nto Dario, but he was sadly mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dario hadn't scrambled down to the mangled
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,carriage that fateful night\Nto look for survivors,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but to root for ill-gotten riches.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.82,0:07:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man, what has he said, Inspector?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he ever tell you\Nthat I gave him the ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, he swore up and down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You filthy liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He swore with good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave him the ring, just as he told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.70,0:08:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him go at once, Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, sir, this man stole from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for Providence's hand in my life,\NI might as well have done the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sell this ring, if you may ease\Nyour family's burden by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk an honest path henceforth,\Nand I give it gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.86,0:08:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew he didn't owe Dario a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he took Dio in all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The doctor's on his way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, don't hate Dio for what he's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am to blame for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hard on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.44,0:08:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you were a Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:09:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went too easy on Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he might have felt I didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he did this for\Nwant of a father's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.19,0:09:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that he's buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next to Dario.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.06,0:09:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look so sad, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.28,0:09:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're better to die Than\Nin the arms Of my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have lost much this night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A noble man's soul has\Nbeen taken from the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that was good in that man,\Nhe passed it along to Jonathan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,every bit of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can be sure, Jojo's\Ngonna live an upright life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,using what his father gave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:09:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rich folks are rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watching them flounce around, I wanna throw\Nthe whole lot of them into the Thames.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not the Joestars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heroic and merciful and just the\Nwhole damn lot are giants among men.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The body!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's corpse, it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.68,0:10:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oi, Grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Away from the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The inspector!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's impossible.
