Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all filled him full of bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:10:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your distance, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's armed with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it the mosque?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming right at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.36,0:11:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit him with everything you've got left!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come no closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not another step!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it!
