Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.56,0:11:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it before he kills us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shot him in the head and it\Ndidn't even slow him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.88,0:12:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all the lead we put in him\Nhe should be worm food by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, I should thank you for\Nthe source of my newfound power,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.22,0:12:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your father's blood, and the ancient mask.
