Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think, Jojo, think!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.52,0:12:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The knife, father, blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, the mask, my notes, the brain,\Nunknown abilities, unknown strength!
