Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is nothing human left of you, Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't got a chance in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like this lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He broke those coppers to pieces\Nlike they were fleeting twigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.46,0:13:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.84,0:13:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the same, I can't\Nlet Dio kill anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.32,0:13:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This demon must be annihilated!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Jojo, I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll tear you apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.74,0:13:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to my research on the mask,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was fabled to unlock the\Nbrain's hidden potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To vanquish Dio, all I have to do is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.20,0:13:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It smells so delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm going to turn you inside out.
