Dialogue: 2,0:14:13.08,0:14:13.12,SFXOang2,7,0,0,0,,{=31}{\bord0\blur0.8\frz7.832\pos(1425.07,561.24)\4a&HFF&}Whoosh
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.52,0:14:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him now, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please lend me the\Nstrength to do what I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Courage, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.34,0:14:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio is powerful, but\Nyou know how to end him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And end him you must!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.24,0:14:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.26,0:14:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let you\Nkill anyone else! Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.36,0:14:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He caught the sword and spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.96,0:14:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right through the hand\Nand he don't even flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, the hole from where\NI shot him in the head?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.26,0:14:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's healed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.72,0:15:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That spear ain't gonna hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a weakling, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your feet, insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.44,0:15:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've yet to gauge the full\Nextent of my new powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's play a little longer, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust you'll be long since dead\Nby the time I figure them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiding, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were a fool to attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.16,0:15:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have disowned my weakness\Nin favor of life everlasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're behind the curtain\Nlike Polonius and like
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polonius it is there that\Nyou shall meet your end!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's immortal not even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's able to heal faster\Nthan the flames can hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that ain't immortality,\Nthen I'm the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire hurts him, but not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.66,0:16:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get to safety, Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.80,0:16:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Dio wants a fight,\NI mean to give him one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:16:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:16:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flames are gonna box you in up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.70,0:17:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, you brave fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope to hell you've got a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for you, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.30,0:17:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It ends here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.76,0:17:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not allow you to\Nleave this mansion alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! That's lunacy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luring me away from the Gutter Rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How very noble of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.24,0:17:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll drain you dry, and your blood will\Nhelp me mend from this little adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.74,0:18:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You climb the wall in vain, Jojo,\Nin your haste to flee from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have done is guaranteed your doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will be consumed tonight\Nby the inferno below, or by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.42,0:18:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the rising smoke\Nguide your soul to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, please, lend me\Nyour aid one final time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the fire burn with your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he mean to accomplish up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're throwing your life away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.86,0:18:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any moment now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:18:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fight as though you want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that moment, Jojo's short\Nlife flashed before his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.94,0:19:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lonely youth, my time with Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did me wrong time and again,\Nso now I'll settle the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The longer the fire burns, the\Nhotter it gets, and Jojo knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.38,0:19:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He means to use the mansion\Nas a funeral pyre and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,burn the devil faster than\Nhe can replenish himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that the house is hot enough,\Nhe's going to knock him back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you lay your\Nhands on me, you insect!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.68,0:19:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only home I've ever known\Nwill be in ashes before the dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.22,0:19:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father is dead, and I am alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.24,0:20:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have nothing left to\Nlose, but my life itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We go to the flames together, Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly die if it\Nmeans an end to your evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die for nothing, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I lose by your sacrifice is\Nthe blood I would have taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.00,0:20:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blacken and burn among the bones\Nof your damnable father, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a god in all but name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the powers at my command,\NI will rule this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, brother, for this great boon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.26,0:20:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not done with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.36,0:20:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't you die already?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.22,0:21:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no escape, Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.66,0:21:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've brought this doom upon yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the knife you\Nused to kill my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So as you did to the man who\Nraised us both, I now do unto you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.96,0:21:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've crushed his arm bones to\Nsplinters, and he's already ablaze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.84,0:21:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but his grip on me is\Nstill that of a vice!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be it, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.24,0:21:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consign us both unto the flames, but\Nperish knowing I will survive this moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for everything you have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even this inferno cannot devour me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.22,0:21:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fulmer, lend me your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.48,0:21:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His desperate cry echoed in the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether urged on by his departed\Nfather or heeding an instinct,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,born of a long familiarity with\Nthe home which burned around him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:22:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he kicked, and that put\Nthem right in line with...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.72,0:22:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The statue of the Joestar\Nfamily's guardian angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.94,0:22:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could a worm like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.10,0:22:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot who I was dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.44,0:22:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bloody his nose, and he\Ncomes back twice as fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.84,0:22:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had such plans for this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.10,0:22:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on such plans!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.10,0:22:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.10,0:22:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.01,0:22:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lucky bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.62,0:22:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.10,0:22:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo bested him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.72,0:23:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.03,0:23:10.62,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.90,0:23:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.62,0:23:14.16,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.06,0:23:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.16,0:23:19.50,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.32,0:23:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning, driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.50,0:23:22.17,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.16,0:23:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.17,0:23:26.68,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.62,0:23:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.14,0:23:37.73,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.73,0:23:41.27,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.10,0:23:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.27,0:23:46.61,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning, driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:46.61,0:23:49.24,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.24,0:23:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.24,0:23:53.29,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.98,0:23:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In and around the lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.29,0:23:55.66,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.72,0:23:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miles come out of the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:56.92,0:23:59.13,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.10,0:24:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they'll stand there.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:59.13,0:24:00.92,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.86,0:24:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One mile over.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:04.05,0:24:07.72,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.26,0:24:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be there and we'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.26,0:24:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten and two summers.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:10.51,0:24:14.18,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.80,0:24:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be there and laughing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.76,0:24:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty, forty, five mile.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:16.94,0:24:20.56,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Twenty-four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.80,0:24:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we'll see. I'll be there with you!
Dialogue: 1,0:24:20.56,0:24:23.57,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,There with you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.80,0:24:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
